{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/M7a1A2J5rPsWYrSAy7uprg?scene=1&click_id=4","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:45.989239+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/M7a1A2J5rPsWYrSAy7uprg?scene=1&click_id=4","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Vh8tofn6SZ4u9kEEhtgLLR8p0vgeTEWDrvSRQPVOzVIsUL1K5cfufZ1icJJoRpwotvcpMicZFTKa5hLceM42auibA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>长安大学汽车学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名工作即日起开展，现将我院预报名有关事宜通知如下。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>长安大学汽车学院起源于1951年交通部西安汽车机械学校，诞生于新中国百业待兴之际，成长于中国汽车工业振兴发展之时，鼎兴于百年汽车工业巨变浪潮之中，与民族汽车工业携手同行七十余载。学院作为国家“211工程”、“985优势学科创新平台”和国家“双一流”学科重点建设单位，始终以振兴国家为使命，致力于培养汽车领域栋梁之才，为我国交通运输业和民族汽车制造业发展作出了重要贡献。</span></p><p><span>学院现有教职工120人，其中专任教师87人，博导34人，硕导81人。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>硕士：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.080204车辆工程 （学硕）</span><span><br/></span><span>2.0802J2智能电动车辆（学硕）</span></p><p><span>3.082300交通运输工程（学硕）</span></p><p><span>4.[筹]低空技术与工程（学硕）</span></p><p><span>5.085502车辆工程（专硕）</span></p><p><span>6.086100交通运输（专硕）</span></p><p><span><br/></span><strong><span>博士：</span></strong><span><br/></span><span>1.080204 车辆工程   </span></p><p><span>2.082304 载运工具运用工程 </span></p><p><span>3.0802J2 智能电动车辆</span></p><p><span>4.[筹]低空技术与工程</span></p><p><span>实际招生专业和研究方向以我学校最终正式发布的2026年招生简章和专业目录为准。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2.2026届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></p><p><span>3.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>4.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.</span><span>申请人可于8月11日起登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（http://49.233.141.142/xly/login）填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>有意向申请我院2026年推免研究生的同学，请加qq群：698980205，姓名+本科学校+拟申请方向，学院近期将组织学科与专业介绍线上宣讲活动。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Vh8tofn6SZ7FsvvhNbrQPSoPoxkKwMwOfomicwOZzYOvVxOv8RvTFPH5uPg0VXiam1CdcIWBkNb8bFvNEZD4sz5g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人将以下材料按照1-6项顺序整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M），上传至学校推免生预报名系统。</span></p><p><span><span>1.个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></span></p><p><span>2.本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明(由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章)；</span></p><p><span>3.英语水平证明材料（CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等成绩单）；</span></p><p><span>4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>5.参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></p><p><span>6.申请直博还需要两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的推荐信。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格审查</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>与考核</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.资格审核：我院将9月起分批次对申请人报名信息进行资格初审，通过资格初审的申请人方可进入复试考核环节。</span></p><p><span>2.考核工作：我院接收2026年推免生的复试安排，以学院后续通知为准。复试内容和要求参照我院2025年复试安排。请申请人及时关注我院官网通知，保持手机畅通，并按要求参加考核工作。学院将根据申请者考核成绩择优录取。</span></p><p><span>3.所有报考我院的推免生在取得所在学校的推免资格后，即可登录“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”(以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm)，填写报考志愿、接收并确认复试及待录取通知。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.未尽事宜请以长安大学2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知为准，网址：</span></p><p><span>https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2025/0809/c2769a254078/page.htm</span></p><p><span>2.直接攻读博士研究生招生专业、导师名单可参考《长安大学2025年招收攻读博士学位研究生招生简章》及学院专业目录，申请人应提前与报考导师联系并征得同意。</span></p><p><span>3.建议申请人提前联系报考导师，如对招生专业、报考过程、研究方向等信息有疑问，可在报名阶段咨询学院和导师。</span></p><p><span>4. 未进行预报名的推免生届时可登录教育部“推免服务系统”进行报名，我院将根据实际情况组织复试，具体安排以学院后续通知为准。</span></p><p><span>5. 招生咨询</span></p><p><span>联系人：贾老师</span></p><p><span>联系方式：029-82334474、</span></p><p><span>jialinke@chd.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>近期热文</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTI4NjYzMA==&amp;mid=2247548049&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=01837329a0a6975d8acf8b583f77d01a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Vh8tofn6SZ7FsvvhNbrQPSoPoxkKwMwOgfD3q0YkndJGg7picPu2YI1OzSXbHgOzOC1txcGduH4tlzJMLxeXJYg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>“这些钱，你拿着上大学！”</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTI4NjYzMA==&amp;mid=2247548044&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c85fcadae06be284c117c0fc14eb1aab&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Vh8tofn6SZ7FsvvhNbrQPSoPoxkKwMwO1IZdtfZVpyY52f0xl41tw6mlocePSEtnxLULtsIDnHuImFcmqYZHPg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>社会实践 | 长安大学“汽启深学·赋能致远”暑期社会实践队：感悟科技强国与红色传承</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NTI4NjYzMA==&amp;mid=2247548019&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e802439d5ffa7dcc68668be9d318e930&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Vh8tofn6SZ7FsvvhNbrQPSoPoxkKwMwO7mriag0mt9ynBGNABBZIuKKjloBb3OagxfQhGwWQtD8Nicuzmw5Kv3Qw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>汽车学院彩虹心理协会主席团已就位，速来围观~</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>共青团长安大学汽车学院委员会</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>图文 | 汽车学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 戴谦翔</span></p><p><span>初审 | 马程雄</span></p><p><span>终审 | 汤皓添</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Vh8tofn6SZ4u9kEEhtgLLR8p0vgeTEWDibBzOrkRiaTJnjnwIG4icJqE74yg2JlMapMIpiaBwrpeLIucsKib3VQQj8w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Vh8tofn6SZ4u9kEEhtgLLR8p0vgeTEWDYCBzVjfLbsnwqlnVkVicU9rVcgMIU4aM54APB0ticvicMWJ3d5yG9TuWQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"604d96c5cfc7f57df2fbc6f13a4de7e180ea97066c252ee03f20c524e0fe268e","textLength":1735,"sourceSha256":"f60e8bcf3a071a2da2d9f92b6e91af009241e9d67bdb94af27f9da291ecd878a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-aa9f7e41278be55ea24e","title":"2025年长安大学汽车学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:45.989239+00:00"}
